    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: LLM commander L-1 (CE-4676, DESIGN_LLM_Commander \u00a71) - a body-less Platoon (TKB 305) whose brain is a SEAT (CommanderSeat, Mind Scripted: no own play, InertSop) over Alpha Squad and Bravo Squad (4 men each) at the start (200,40) on test-town; Red's Defenders (5 men, SquadDefend + BasicSquadSop, the full game AI) hold the sheds ('house', 64,108). Named points: house, objective (100,80), support (140,90), start. The scripted mind sends both squads to the objective; on the first SPOT the squad nearest the enemy attacks the reported place and the other supports by fire from 'support'. Judge: (1) a squad is attacking within 1 s of sim time of the first SPOT/CONTACT into the platoon; (2) the platoon's own play never runs (no PlatoonHold, no ReactToFireFromBuilding); (3) each squad fights with its own AI and reports at least once to the platoon; (4) the fight ends before the time limit. Fail: no order after the spot, an order from the platoon's own SOP, a squad that never reports. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh llm-platoon-attack"
